## 3. Booking State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIATED: User starts booking
    INITIATED --> HOLD_REQUESTED: Seats selected
    HOLD_REQUESTED --> HELD: Provider hold success
    HOLD_REQUESTED --> HOLD_FAILED: Provider hold failed
    HELD --> PAYMENT_PENDING: Payment intent created
    HELD --> HOLD_EXPIRED: TTL expired
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_SUCCESS: Gateway confirms
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED: Gateway rejects
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> HOLD_EXPIRED: TTL expired during payment
    PAYMENT_SUCCESS --> BOOKING_REQUESTED: BookSeats called
    BOOKING_REQUESTED --> CONFIRMED: Provider confirms
    BOOKING_REQUESTED --> BOOKING_UNKNOWN: Timeout/network error
    BOOKING_REQUESTED --> BOOKING_FAILED: Provider rejects
    BOOKING_UNKNOWN --> CONFIRMED: Reconciliation confirms
    BOOKING_UNKNOWN --> BOOKING_FAILED: Reconciliation rejects
    BOOKING_FAILED --> REFUND_PENDING: Auto-refund initiated
    REFUND_PENDING --> REFUNDED: Refund completed
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLATION_REQUESTED: User cancels
    CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: Provider cancels
    CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> CANCELLATION_FAILED: Provider rejects
    CANCELLED --> REFUND_PENDING: Refund initiated
    HOLD_FAILED --> [*]
    HOLD_EXPIRED --> [*]
    PAYMENT_FAILED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
```

### Valid State Transitions Table

| From | To | Trigger | Side Effects |
|------|----|---------|-------------|
| INITIATED | HOLD_REQUESTED | User selects seats | Redis lock acquired |
| HOLD_REQUESTED | HELD | Provider HoldSeats success | Store HoldId, snapshot fares |
| HOLD_REQUESTED | HOLD_FAILED | Provider HoldSeats failure | Release Redis lock |
| HELD | PAYMENT_PENDING | Payment intent created | Payment record created |
| HELD | HOLD_EXPIRED | TTL elapsed | Release Redis lock, cleanup |
| PAYMENT_PENDING | PAYMENT_SUCCESS | Webhook/verification | Payment record updated |
| PAYMENT_PENDING | PAYMENT_FAILED | Webhook/verification | Release hold, cleanup |
| PAYMENT_SUCCESS | BOOKING_REQUESTED | BookSeats called | Provider transaction record |
| BOOKING_REQUESTED | CONFIRMED | Provider success | Store TicketNo, PNRNo, generate ticket |
| BOOKING_REQUESTED | BOOKING_UNKNOWN | Timeout | Queue reconciliation job |
| BOOKING_REQUESTED | BOOKING_FAILED | Provider failure | Queue refund |
| BOOKING_FAILED | REFUND_PENDING | Auto-triggered | Refund record created |
| REFUND_PENDING | REFUNDED | Refund confirmed | Wallet/gateway credited |
| CONFIRMED | CANCELLATION_REQUESTED | User/admin action | IsCancellable check |
| CANCELLATION_REQUESTED | CANCELLED | Provider CancelSeats success | Refund initiated |
| CANCELLATION_REQUESTED | CANCELLATION_FAILED | Provider rejects | Booking stays confirmed |
| CANCELLED | REFUND_PENDING | Auto-triggered | Refund record created |

