## 6. Payment Flow

```
Client selects seats
        │
Backend creates booking (INITIATED)
        │
Backend calls HoldSeats → HELD
        │
Backend creates payment intent (PhonePe order)
        │ → Booking status: PAYMENT_PENDING
        │
Client redirected to PhonePe checkout
        │
PhonePe processes payment
        │
    ┌───┴───┐
    │       │
Webhook  Client returns
    │       │
Backend verifies payment via:
  1. Webhook signature validation
  2. Server-side status check API
        │
PAYMENT_SUCCESS
        │
Backend calls BookSeats(HoldId)
        │
    ┌───┴───┐
    │       │
 Success  Timeout/Error
    │       │
CONFIRMED  BOOKING_UNKNOWN
    │       │
Generate  Queue reconciliation
ticket    (BookingStatus check)
```

> [!CAUTION]
> Never trust the client-side payment redirect as proof of payment. Always verify via webhook + server-side status API.

