## 8. Redis Namespace Design

```
cache:cities:{provider}              → city list (TTL: 24h)
cache:search:{provider}:{hash}       → search results (TTL: 5 min)
cache:chart:{provider}:{hash}        → seat chart (TTL: 2 min)

lock:seat:{provider}:{busId}:{date}:{seatNo} → distributed lock (TTL: 30s)
lock:provider-auth:{provider}        → auth token refresh lock
lock:booking:{bookingId}             → booking mutation lock

session:refresh:{tokenFamily}        → refresh token metadata

rate:api:{ip}                        → API rate limit counter
rate:auth:{email}                    → Auth attempt rate limit
rate:booking:{userId}                → Booking rate limit

idem:{key}                           → idempotency record (TTL: 24h)

provider:token:{provider}            → cached access token (TTL: 80 min)
provider:health:{provider}           → circuit breaker state

queue:*                              → BullMQ managed
```

