## 9. Circuit Breaker Design

```
Provider: GDS
States: CLOSED → OPEN → HALF_OPEN → CLOSED

Thresholds:
  - Failure count window: 60 seconds
  - Failure threshold: 5 failures in window → OPEN
  - Open duration: 30 seconds → HALF_OPEN
  - Half-open probe: 1 request allowed
  - Success in half-open → CLOSED
  - Failure in half-open → OPEN (reset timer)

Tracked failures:
  - Connection timeout
  - HTTP 5xx
  - HTTP 429
  - Network errors

NOT tracked as failures:
  - HTTP 4xx (business errors)
  - Seat unavailable
  - Invalid parameters
  - Auth failures (handled separately)
```

